      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "自动炮塔负责守线，采集无人机同时从危险区域搬回战利品",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Build automatic turrets, use drones to collect loot and improve your skills to increase your chances of survival.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2845630/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "先钻入洞穴开采升级资源，再及时退出地牢切换到动态怪潮战斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Drill caves in search of different resources to upgrade your equipment, weapons and Mech Spider. It's worth saying that the local fauna didn't like the fact that you want to mine their sources! So don't forget to exit the dungeons, and switch to a dynamic combat mode.",
